/// <code>PESurchargeError</code> when the value or configuration is invalid.
/// <ul>
///   <li>
///     <code>.fixedSurchargeAlreadySet</code>, <code>.noSurchargeCeilingDeclared</code>, and <code>.negativeAmount</code> do not
///     consume the decision: correct the value and call a decision method again.
